# Fix Login Failure and User Creation

The admin login fails because the user creation process is broken. [init_admin.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/init_admin.py) calls [create_user](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/crud/user.py#15-28) which crashes due to a missing `security` import. Additionally, [auth.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/debug_auth.py) calls [create_user](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/crud/user.py#15-28) with an argument that [create_user](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/crud/user.py#15-28) does not accept.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change modifies how users are created and passwords are hashed. It centralizes password logic in [utils/security.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/utils/security.py).

## Proposed Changes

### Backend

#### [MODIFY] [security.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/utils/security.py)
- Add [get_password_hash(password)](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/routers/auth.py#26-28) and [verify_password(plain_password, hashed_password)](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/routers/auth.py#20-25) functions.

#### [MODIFY] [user.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/crud/user.py)
- Import `security` from `utils`.
- Update [create_user](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/crud/user.py#15-28) signature to accept an optional `hashed_password`.
- Use the provided `hashed_password` or generate one using `security.get_password_hash`.

#### [MODIFY] [auth.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/routers/auth.py)
- Remove local definitions of [get_password_hash](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/routers/auth.py#26-28) and [verify_password](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/routers/auth.py#20-25).
- Import them from `utils.security`.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `python backend/init_admin.py` (requires DB connection, might depend on environment).
- Run a small script to verify imports and [create_user](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/crud/user.py#15-28) function signature.

### Manual Verification
- User should rebuild/restart docker containers: `docker-compose up --build`.
- User should verify that [init_admin.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/init_admin.py) runs successfully (admin user created).
- User should verify login with `admin@synapseplan.com` / [admin](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/init_admin.py#10-46).
